gamesImproved translationsThe demo has improved a lot, so if you haven't played it yet, please give it a try!","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-10-24T10:26:34Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1847286114039329","verified_at":"2026-10-24T13:28:10Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-4996240-1847286114035260","game_id":"steam-4996240","kind":"update","title":"Demo Update v0.3.97","summary":"This update includes the following changes:New minigame in the blast simulation sceneImproved hints in the bone sorting gameMinor translation fixesWe hope you continue to enjoy the demo!","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-10-23T07:13:40Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1847286114035260","verified_at":"2026-10-23T09:49:28Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-4996240-1847286114031675","game_id":"steam-4996240","kind":"update","title":"Demo Update v0.3.96 – 50+ Improvements Since Launch So Far","summary":"Thank you to everyone who has played the demo!Since the demo launched on October 8, we've made more than 50 changes, many of them based on your feedback.This version includes the following changes:Improved the voiceprint matching minigameImproved the identification scene.Added arrow-key controls for moving bones to the trays in the bone sorting minigameAdded new music and sound effectsOther minor UI fixesWe're still collecting survey responses and feedback from players. Please answer using the s","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-10-22T08:07:49Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1847286114031675","verified_at":"2026-10-22T12:07:14Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-4996240-1846651706689978","game_id":"steam-4996240","kind":"announcement","title":"A Car Explodes. Only Bone Fragments Remain. Solve the Case in the Free Demo","summary":"Bone to Pick is a forensic mystery visual novel where you solve cases by reading bones. In the free demo, you can play the first case, \"The Bombed Car,\" from start to finish (about 30 minutes). A car driving through the city suddenly explodes. All that's left in the wreckage are fragments of the driver's bones. Examine the bones, talk to people, and confront them with the evidence to find out who died and who is behind it. We're also taking part in Steam Next Fest. If you enjoy it, please add Bo","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-10-19T12:21:36Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1846651706689978","verified_at":"2026-10-20T20:16:51Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-4996240-1846018067929725","game_id":"steam-4996240","kind":"announcement","title":"The Free Demo Is Out Now!","summary":"The free demo of Bone to Pick is now available.You can play the first case, \"The Bombed Car,\" from start to finish.A car driving through the city suddenly explodes.All that's left in the wreckage are fragments of the driver's bones.Examine the bones, talk to people, and confront them with the evidence to find out who died and who is behind it.Search the bones for marks with a loupe and lightMatch a voiceprintFind the center of the blast inside the burnt-out carEnjoy the banter with your quirky l","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-10-08T13:38:54Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1846018067929725","verified_at":"2026-10-20T20:16:51Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"}],"analyses":[],"news_status":{"